      "outcome": "deny",
      "reason": "scp",
      "cites": "https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/reference_policies_evaluation-logic.html 'If an SCP denies the action, the request is denied, even if identity-based policies allow it'"
    },
    {
      "id": "d11",
