      "outcome": "deny",
      "reason": "permission_boundary",
      "cites": "https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/reference_policies_evaluation-logic.html 'the permissions boundary must allow the action; the effective permissions are the intersection'"
